OL,3,GNEWSACity centre market to relocate for
OL,4,A12 months
OL,5,
OL,6,FA centuries-old market will temporarily
OL,7,Fmove while a #96m city centre
OL,8,Fredevelopment gets under way.
OL,10,FCambridge's Market Square has welcomed
OL,11,Ftraders since the Middle Ages and the
OL,12,Frevamp is part of the redevelopment of
OL,13,Fthe wider area, known as the Civic
OL,14,FQuarter.
OL,16,FA Cambridge City Council report said
OL,17,Fmarket traders would be moved to other
OL,18,Fnearby locations after Easter and would
OL,19,Fbe offered a 50% reduction for the
OL,20,Ftemporary pitches.
OL,23,APub: 11-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
